{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/cli.ts",
    "title": "捕获与 ACP 探测命令行入口",
    "summary": "该模块把文件、Git、Lark、Hook 和原始 Capture 输入转换为服务端捕获请求，并提供直接 ACP profile 探测；它是薄客户端，不承担持久化。",
    "category": "workflow",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "dispatch",
        "title": "命令分派与数据路径",
        "body": "CLI 从本地配置推导服务地址，也允许 `OMEM_URL` 覆盖；`send` 统一发送 JSON POST，并在配置 token 时附带 Bearer 认证。`capture` 从指定 JSON 文件或 stdin 读取；`file`、`git`、`lark` 和 `hook` 先调用对应 connector 生成 CaptureInput，再用共享 captureSchema 校验，最终都提交到 `/api/captures`。[[c1]]\n\n`probe` 是例外：它不经过 HTTP，而是从本地 profile 配置中选择目标并直接调用 `acp()`。因此 probe 验证的是当前进程的 Agent transport 条件，不等同于服务端 API 或完整助手回合可用性。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "boundaries",
        "title": "输出与失败边界",
        "body": "缺失必要参数会立即报错；Git 未给 ref 时默认 HEAD，probe 未给 profile 时默认查找 `traex`。未知命令打印帮助并以成功状态退出。成功结果通常格式化输出到 stdout，但 hook 特意保持 stdout 为空，避免其输出被宿主误当成指令；异常写 stderr 并设置退出码 1。[[c3]]\n\nCLI 自身没有重试、超时或响应结构校验，除 captureSchema 外的路径、文件大小和 Git ref 安全边界由 connector 实现；服务端认证、持久化和领域规则则由目标 API 承担。[[c1]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "HTTP 发送与捕获命令",
        "reason": "支持服务地址、认证头、输入读取、connector 转换及统一捕获 API 的说明。",
        "relation": "calls",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/cli.ts",
          "startLine": 6,
          "endLine": 56
        },
        "quote": "const [command, ...args] = process.argv.slice(2);\nconst config = loadConfig();\nconst base = process.env.OMEM_URL || `http://127.0.0.1:${config.port}`;\nconst stdin = async () => {\n  const chunks = [];\n  for await (const c of process.stdin) chunks.push(c);\n  return Buffer.concat(chunks).toString();\n};\nconst send = async "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "本地 ACP profile 探测",
        "reason": "说明 probe 直接读取本地 profile 并调用 ACP，而非请求服务端。",
        "relation": "calls",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/cli.ts",
          "startLine": 57,
          "endLine": 66
        },
        "quote": "  } else if (command === \"probe\") {\n    const p = config.profiles.find((p) => p.id === (args[0] || \"traex\"));\n    if (!p) throw Error(\"Profile not found\");\n    result = await acp(\n      p,\n      config.agentCwd,\n      null,\n      () => {},\n      new AbortController().signal,\n    );"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "帮助、Hook 静默与退出码",
        "reason": "支持未知命令、hook stdout 约束以及异常退出行为。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/cli.ts",
          "startLine": 67,
          "endLine": 77
        },
        "quote": "  } else {\n    console.log(\n      \"omem CLI: capture [json-file] | file <path> | git <repo> <file> [ref] | lark <url> | hook < stdin | probe [profile]\",\n    );\n    process.exit(0);\n  }\n  // Hook stdout must remain empty so it cannot accidentally become host instructions.\n  if (command !== \"hook\") console.log(JSON.strin"
      }
    ],
